    <bf:summary>
      <bf:Summary>
	<rdfs:label>Issued also in electronic format.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Summary>
    </bf:summary>
    <bf:summary>
      <bf:Summary>
	<rdfs:label>"In this sweet picture book, Nevin and Grandpa Frank are going to the park on a spring day. Grandpa lets Nevin lead the way, from choosing what shoes to wear and which direction to walk to deciding where to play, and finally, which flowers to bring home for Nana"-- Provided by the publisher.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Summary>
    </bf:summary>
